Arguments after ++ (3): a b c
Anything we print in the code ends up in the output

loop begin
  variable   substitution: first
  embedded   substitution: firstone
  expression substitution: first and another 1
  expression substitution: begin first end
  expression substitution: 1
1 expression substitution: at the start of the first line.
  variable   substitution: second
  embedded   substitution: secondone
  expression substitution: second and another 2
  expression substitution: begin second end
  expression substitution: 2
2 expression substitution: at the start of the second line.
  variable   substitution: third
  embedded   substitution: thirdone
  expression substitution: third and another 3
  expression substitution: begin third end
  expression substitution: 3
3 expression substitution: at the start of the third line.
loop end
  expression substitution: InTheMiddle
  expression substitution: > not padded! <
  expression substitution: > left        <
  expression substitution: >       right <
  expression substitution: None None; Left left      ; Right       right;

no substitutions $index \n 5'b0 "hello" $names[$index]
